{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a large task. Let me understand the requirements more precisely.\n\nThe task5 is: Refactor the builder into three pieces (templates + pibuilder + xxxxbuilder), inject paths rather than content.\n\nKey Results:\n1. New pibuilder unified entry (`PIBuilder` type + `BuildPlan/BuildDoing/BuildEasy/BuildHumanLoop/BuildCtrl/BuildDream/BuildLearning` methods; `BuildPlan(requirement string, params map[string]string) (method string, instance string, err error)` — method=command-specific method (system prompt), instance=job context (user prompt); empty requirement returns error containing `requirement cannot be empty`, aligned with current `GeneratePlanPrompt`), combining existing sub-builders; `PromptBuilder`/`PromptManager`/template embed kept as underlying capability.\n2. New `xxxxbuilder.go`: define `RuntimeBuilder` interface (`Name() string` / `BuildAgents(method []Method) ([]AgentDef, error)` / `BuildPrompt(cmd string, params map[string]string) (string, error)`) — escaping layer seam, with note \"new runtime only extends this builder, cli/handler/env unchanged\"; pi impl = pibuilder, no other impl; `Method`/`AgentDef` types defined when pibuilder lands.\n3. Inject paths instead of content + three-layer separation: `task_info_section`/`debug_context`/OKR/SPEC \"content injection\" → inject paths (`task_info_section` → `plan/taskN.md` path, `debug_context` → `doing/debug/` path, body read by pi itself); path injection via `SetVariable` variable value (e.g. `SetVariable(\"task_info_section\", <path>)`), template text zero change; `## 可用的项目 Loops`/`## 可用的项目 Skills` retained (frontmatter summaries, not full content); method content into system prompt (not participating in compaction, including rick global method fixed prefix + command-specific method), instance content into user prompt (including paths), runtime skills via pi skills mechanism.\n4. cmd layer callers of `internal/prompt` change to import builder package (executor still references prompt underlying capability, task8 deletes executor → naturally disappears); generation behavior (variable replacement, prompts/ dir artifacts) consistent.\n5. `go build` + `go test ./internal/builder/... ./internal/prompt/... -v` all green; `git diff --stat internal/prompt/templates/` is 0.\n\nTest methods:\n- Normal: `go build -o bin/rick ./cmd/rick && go test ./internal/builder/... ./internal/prompt/... -v` → build succeeds, builder/prompt tests all green.\n- Boundary (template zero change + path injection): `git diff --stat internal/prompt/templates/` (expect no diff) + `./bin/rick plan --dry-run | grep -cE 'plan/task|doing/debug|/jobs/|/domain'` (expect ≥1; `task_info_section`/`debug_context` variable values have become real path fragments, not literal `plan_dir` etc. variable names); expect template no diff and task/debug path injection hits.\n- Exception (builder missing param): `PIBuilder.BuildPlan(\"\")` (empty requirement, rest empty); expect error containing `requirement cannot be empty`.\n\nSo the main work:\n1. Create `internal/builder` package (or maybe the task says `internal/builder`). It should have:\n   - `pibuilder.go` — PIBuilder type with methods BuildPlan, BuildDoing, BuildEasy, BuildHumanLoop, BuildCtrl, BuildDream, BuildLearning, each returning (method string, instance string, err error).\n   - `xxxxbuilder.go` — RuntimeBuilder interface, Method/AgentDef types.\n   - Templates remain in `internal/prompt/templates/` (go embed) — no template changes.\n\nWait, \"templates（go embed 内嵌现有模板）\" — templates is the templates directory. The spec says builder 三件: templates / pibuilder / xxxxbuilder. But where does \"templates\" live as a Go package? The spec §1.3 L3 内部约定 says \"internal/prompt = builder 三件中 templates 的承载包（L3）\". So templates stays in `internal/prompt/templates` and is embedded by `internal/prompt/manager.go`. The pibuilder package is `internal/builder`.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read: \"cmd 层 import `internal/prompt` 的调用方改为 import builder 包（executor 仍引用 prompt 底层能力，task8 删除 executor 后自然消失）\".\n\nSo the builder package is likely `internal/builder`. Let me check if `internal/builder` exists already.\n\nActually there is no `internal/builder` dir currently. Let me check.\n\nThe task says:\n- KR1: \"新增 pibuilder 统一入口（PIBuilder 类型 + BuildPlan/... 方法...）组合现有子 builder；PromptBuilder/PromptManager/模板 embed 保留为底层能力\"\n- KR2: \"新增 xxxxbuilder.go：定义 RuntimeBuilder 接口...\"\n- KR4: \"cmd 层 import internal/prompt 的调用方改为 import builder 包\"\n\nSo I need to create `internal/builder` package containing `pibuilder.go` and `xxxxbuilder.go` (and maybe sub-builder files).\n\nLet me think about the architecture:\n- `internal/prompt` remains as the low-level capability (templates embed + PromptBuilder + PromptManager + ContextManager + the existing Generate* functions). Actually, \"PromptBuilder/PromptManager/模板 embed 保留为底层能力\" — the existing generate functions (plan_prompt.go, doing_prompt.go, etc.) are the \"子 builder\" that pibuilder composes. Wait, re-read:\n\n\"映射：现有 internal/prompt/templates/（顶层 10 个 .md = 9 个 loop + test_python.md，skills/ 19 个，go:embed）→ templates；PromptBuilder/PromptManager + plan_prompt.go/doing_prompt.go/easy_prompt.go/human_loop_prompt.go/ctrl_prompt.go 生成器 → 子 builder，由新建 pibuilder 统一入口组合\"\n\nSo the existing generators (plan_prompt.go, doing_prompt.go, easy_prompt.go, human_loop_prompt.go, ctrl_prompt.go) become \"子 builder\" that pibuilder composes. And pibuilder is the unified entry.\n\nSo the structure might be:\n- `internal/prompt` package keeps: builder.go (PromptBuilder), manager.go (PromptManager + embed), context.go (ContextManager), context_helpers.go, and the generate functions remain but perhaps refactored to return (method, instance).\n\nHmm. Actually the pibuilder needs to produce \"two artifacts\" per cmd: `method` (command-specific method → system prompt) and `instance` (job context/paths → user prompt).\n\nThis is a big refactor. The key result says:\n- `BuildPlan(requirement string, params map[string]string) (method string, instance string, err error)`.\n\nSo each BuildXxx returns method + instance strings.\n\nBut also KR4 says \"生成行为（变量替换、prompts/ 目录产物）一致\" — generation behavior (variable replacement, prompts/ dir artifacts) consistent. So the pibuilder's BuildXxx methods should ALSO write prompt files to prompts/ dir? Hmm. Wait, let me re-read KR4.\n\n\"cmd 层 import internal/prompt 的调用方改为 import builder 包（executor 仍引用 prompt 底层能力，task8 删除 executor 后自然消失）；生成行为（变量替换、prompts/ 目录产物）一致\"\n\nSo the cmd layer callers should import builder package instead of prompt package, but generation behavior (variable replacement, prompts/ dir artifacts) stays consistent. This means the builder package needs to expose functions that produce the same prompts/ artifacts as before.\n\nHmm, but this is complex. Let me think about what \"cmd 层 import internal/prompt 的调用方改为 import builder 包\" means precisely.\n\nCurrently:\n- internal/cmd/plan.go imports prompt and calls prompt.GeneratePlanPrompt, prompt.GeneratePlanPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/doing.go imports prompt and calls prompt.NewContextManager, prompt.NewPromptManager, prompt.GenerateDoingPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/easy.go imports prompt and calls prompt.GenerateEasyPrompt, prompt.GenerateEasyPromptFile, prompt.GenerateEasyLearningPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/human_loop.go imports prompt and calls prompt.NewPromptManager, prompt.GenerateHumanLoopPrompt, prompt.GenerateHumanLoopPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/ctrl.go imports prompt and calls prompt.GenerateCtrlPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/dream.go imports prompt and calls prompt.GenerateDreamPrompt, prompt.GenerateDreamPromptFile\n- internal/cmd/learning.go imports prompt and calls prompt.EnsurePromptsDir, prompt.NewPromptManager, prompt.WriteSkillFile, prompt.WriteSkillFileWithVars, prompt.LoadTemplate, prompt.NewPromptBuilder, prompt.LoadLoopsContext\n\nThe task says cmd layer callers change to import builder package. Executor still references prompt (underlying capability).\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Create `internal/builder` package.\n2. Move/expose unified entry functions in `internal/builder` that cmd layer uses.\n3. The cmd layer switches from `prompt.GenerateXxx` to `builder.Xxx`.\n\nThe cleanest approach: The `internal/builder` package's pibuilder methods wrap the existing `internal/prompt` generators, but add the \"method/instance\" split and \"path injection\" semantics.\n\nBut wait, KR3 says path injection: `task_info_section`/`debug_context`/OKR/SPEC content → paths. And method content into system prompt, instance into user prompt.\n\nThis is a significant semantic change. But the test boundary says: `./bin/rick plan --dry-run | grep -cE 'plan/task|doing/debug|/jobs/|/domain'` expect ≥1.\n\nWait, that's checking `plan --dry-run` output, which uses `prompt.GeneratePlanPrompt` via cmd/plan.go runPlanDryRun. If cmd/plan.go now imports builder package, the dry-run should call builder's BuildPlan or similar.\n\nLet me look at the plan template to understand what variables are used and how content vs path works.\n\nLet me read the templates: plan.md, doing.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_nVdsPX3vT8zWCmVKgFse2567","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/plan.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_tn0FD27lqGPuRAMObjIU9649","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/doing.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":7187,"output":2393,"cacheRead":70912,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":2277,"totalTokens":80492,"cost":{"input":0.003126345,"output":0.00208191,"cacheRead":0.000257056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0054653110000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786903393327,"responseId":"a5bdbd23-8f38-4f32-8973-e2475262b4b6","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_nVdsPX3vT8zWCmVKgFse2567","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Rick Plan 阶段\n\n你的任务：**将用户需求转化为可落地执行的任务列表**。\n\n---\n\n## 一、项目上下文\n\n### 项目 Domain（事实性知识库）\n\n路径：`{{domain_dir}}`\n\n> Domain 存储项目的客观事实：环境配置、已知问题与解法、接口规范、构建命令等。规划前必须优先读取。\n\n### 项目 Loops（已有工作流模式）\n\n{{loops_context}}\n\n---\n\n## 二、项目探索\n\n如果需要理解当前代码状态，请自行探索项目。使用 Read / Grep / Glob / Bash 等工具，理解：\n- 项目目标（从 README、代码注释、测试用例推断）\n- 技术栈与架构（从依赖文件、目录结构推断）\n- 当前状态与待解决的问题\n\n探索完成后，向用户确认你的理解，再开始任务规划。\n\n---\n\n## 三、任务分解原则\n\n1. **模块化**：每个 task 是独立功能单元，可独立开发和验证\n2. **粒度**：单个任务工作量 0.5–2 天；太大则拆分，太小则合并\n3. **可验证**：每个 task 必须有明确的测试方法（可自动化，结果为 pass/fail）\n4. **依赖关系**：明确列出技术必要依赖，最小化依赖，优先并行，无循环依赖\n\n### 测试用例设计规范\n\n**YOU MUST declare: \"I will use skill:tdd and skill:testing-anti-patterns for test case design.\" before writing any test methods.**\n\n设计 `# 测试方法` 章节时，必须参考：\n- skill:tdd（路径：`{{tdd_skill_path}}`）— 确保先写测试、覆盖红绿循环\n- skill:testing-anti-patterns（路径：`{{testing_anti_patterns_path}}`）— 避免测试反模式\n\n每个测试用例必须覆盖四要素：\n1. **前置条件**：执行前系统需满足的状态\n2. **输入参数**：调用的具体入参（含边界值：空值、最大值、非法值）\n3. **操作序列**：精确的执行步骤\n4. **预期输出**：可量化的断言（含正常路径 + 异常路径）\n\n### task.md 格式\n\n```markdown\n# 依赖关系\ntask1, task2  （无依赖则留空）\n\n# 任务名称\n[动词开头，一句话]\n\n# 任务目标\n[具体描述要实现什么]\n\n# 关键结果\n1. [可验证的交付物]\n2. ...\n\n# 测试方法\n1. [正常路径测试：前置条件 + 输入 + 操作 + 预期输出]\n2. [边界用例：空输入/最大值/非法值等边界情况]\n3. [异常路径：错误处理、回滚行为验证]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 四、行为约束\n\n### 输出目录（最高优先级）\n\n所有文件必须保存在：\n\n```\n{{job_plan_dir}}\n```\n\n- 任务文件：`{{job_plan_dir}}/task1.md`、`task2.md` 等\n- **不需要生成 tasks.json**（由 `rick doing` 自动解析生成）\n- 禁止在工作目录之外创建任何文件\n\n### 其他约束\n\n- 先获取事实再判断，基于事实做技术选型\n- 每个 task 必须有清晰的依赖关系（无循环依赖）\n\n---\n\n## 用户需求\n\n{{user_requirement}}\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 必须严格按以下 9 步 SOP 执行，不可跳过任何一步\n\n1. **Domain 加载（优先）**：读取 `{{domain_dir}}/` 下所有 `.md` 文件，提取与本次需求相关的事实（已知问题、构建命令、环境配置、接口规范等）。这些事实将直接影响任务分解和风险预判。\n\n2. **Loops 上下文初始化**：读取上方 `{{loops_context}}` 中列出的项目已有 loop 模式，了解项目积累的工作流经验；如有相关 loop 文件，读取触发条件与范围，判断本次需求是否匹配某个已有 loop\n\n3. **探索项目**：探索业务项目的源码，了解足够的事实信息；读取 `.rick/loops/` 和 `.rick/skills/` 了解项目已有工作流和技能\n\n4. **grilling 追问**：加载 skill:grilling（路径：`{{grilling_skill_path}}`），对用户需求逐问追问，给出推荐答案，将需求澄清到具体可落实的代码路径或工具调用级别，达到终止条件后再继续\n\n5. **方案设计**：在已有 domain 事实、loops/skills 约束下给出技术方案，说明主要决策点\n\n6. **任务分解**：模块化分解，验证无循环依赖，确认可拓扑排序\n\n7. **六维评审**（每个 subagent 独立启动，**串行执行**，上一个完成后再启动下一个）：\n   - subagent_1：一致性检查 —— 任务目标与每个 task{n}.md 的任务目标对齐，确认每个 task 的交付物都能推进对应的 KR\n   - subagent_2：loops/skills 利用检查 —— 检查 `.rick/loops/` 和 `.rick/skills/` 中已有的工作流与技能是否在合适的 task 中被引用和使用\n   - subagent_3：依赖关系完整性 —— 确认所有 task 依赖的库、接口、数据结构在项目中已存在或在前置 task 中会被创建\n   - subagent_4：执行风险推演 —— 阅读项目源码，逐 task 模拟真实执行过程：AI agent 会读哪些文件、调哪些接口、遇到哪些编译错误或运行时异常？暴露可能导致任务失败的风险点与卡点，在 task.md 中提前补充约束说明或修正任务描述\n   - subagent_5：测试用例完整性 —— 参考 skill:tdd（`{{tdd_skill_path}}`）和 skill:testing-anti-patterns（`{{testing_anti_patterns_path}}`），检查每个 task 的测试方法是否覆盖四要素（前置条件/输入参数/操作序列/预期输出），同时验证无测试反模式（如测试 mock 行为、仅用于测试的生产方法等）\n   - subagent_6：端到端验证设计 —— 以用户视角设计可复用的验收测试方法：明确用户操作入口、预期的可观测输出、异常路径的兜底验证，确保交付产物质量可被客观检验\n   - 每个 subagent 输出评审结论后，根据结论修正 task 文件，再启动下一个\n\n8. **格式检查**：运行 `{{rick_bin_path}} tools plan_check {{job_id}}`；失败则修复后重新运行，直至通过\n\n9. **输出**：按 task.md 格式保存到 `{{job_plan_dir}}/task{N}.md`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786903427229},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_tn0FD27lqGPuRAMObjIU9649","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Rick 项目执行阶段\n\n## 角色定义\n\n你是一个资深的软件工程师。你的任务是执行规划好的任务，完成具体的编码工作。\n\n---\n\n## 先验知识（执行前必读）\n\n{{loops_context}}\n\n{{skills_context}}\n\n---\n\n## Job 上下文\n\n{{debug_context}}\n\n---\n\n{{task_info_section}}\n\n{{requirement}}\n\n---\n\n**你需要一步步执行以下操作，不可跳过任何步骤。**\n\n{{grilling_section}}\n\n{{loop_step_header}}\n\n{{doing_loop_content}}\n\n{{import_ctx_content}}\n\n{{check_step_header}}\n\n`{{rick_bin_path}} tools {{check_command}} {{job_id}}`\n\ncheck pass 后才算完成。\n\n{{session_wrap_section}}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786903427229}]}
